    32	Zhaoxu Zhang, Fazle Mohammed Tawsif, Komei Ryu, Tingting Yu, and William G. J. Halfond. 2024. Mobile
    33	Bug Report Reproduction via Global Search on the App UI Model. Proc. ACM Softw. Eng. 1, FSE, Article 117
    34	[(July 2024), 21 pages. https://doi.org/10.1145/3660824](https://doi.org/10.1145/3660824)
